{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S06、S08、S11等短停留段的纵向信息明显偏密，连续扫读不如X轻松，容易顾不上音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更密，但【】把每段真正的心理转折标了出来，观众更容易抓住他从不愿受委屈、舍不得亲近，到害怕孤单、最终带着想念继续生活的内在逻辑。它的感受描述也更贴近具体音乐变化，有动作、声音、身体反应和情绪之间的细微联系，前后呼应比X更充分。X胜在扫读负担小、叙事一眼能顺下来，但感受部分相对概括，音乐与心理的对应不够细。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa7d91fa-f9e4-4735-8b3a-6bcc10728709", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054545699098Z", "elapsed_seconds": 73.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:46:59.661183+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cbe90f5a5402e3aea5d0f32ca7dd5788c32a70f111dfe31f57693500f3fe4cf7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2